## Main results

* `eLpNorm_jumpFunction_dyadicSet_conv_le`: (`eq:Sk_jump`) over the dyadic set `{2^{jα}}`.
* `IsHomogeneousCZKernel.eLpNorm_modulatedSI_zero_le`: `L^p` bound for `T = 𝓗^{(0)}`.
* `IsHomogeneousCZKernel.eLpNorm_jumpFunction_ljSmoothTrunc_le`: jumps of the smooth
